**validate.hpp validates external calibration profiles before application.**

## Interface

`gamepad::unstable::controller::calibration::validate(const profile&, string&) noexcept -> bool` checks version, finiteness, positive stick/trigger ranges, fractional drift threshold, and non-negative motion/smoothing values; failure sets `why` and returns `false`.

## Dependencies

`profile` comes from `calibration/profile.hpp`; `string` and utility types come from `support/types.hpp` and `support/utility.hpp`.